&lt;li value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;An understanding of relational databases, structured query language, data modeling, caching, background processing, and backend performance practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Experience contributing to user-facing workflows and maintaining their underlying systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Experience writing backend unit and integration tests, with familiarity with the testing pyramid, Git, and collaborative code review processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;5&quot;&gt;Experience using artificial intelligence coding agents and reviewing their output, or an interest in building these skills in a complex monorepo.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Clear written and spoken English communication skills, including sharing useful status updates in a remote, asynchronous environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;7&quot;&gt;The ability to manage assigned priorities, work through ambiguity, take ownership of your work, and seek guidance when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
